{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T19:22:09.322Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_08520c685d1a1132016a93315e4f4487d2948781cadcfcb8c6","status":"completed","call_id":"call_JojyKOV7I7TiQ83V2WKpypWY","name":"exec","input":"const rs = await Promise.all([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire enable --help\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:5000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire status --help 2>/dev/null || entire status\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:5000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire auth status 2>/dev/null || true\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3000})\n]);\nrs.forEach((r,i)=>text(`---${i+1}---\\n${r.output}`));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a04e66-c772-7170-b7f2-4f6daa7e2bfb","create_time":1788031321.803727}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T19:22:11.580Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a04ef8-ecfc-7480-9c85-dc5d1100c840","call_id":"call_JojyKOV7I7TiQ83V2WKpypWY","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---1---\n/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nEnable Entire with session tracking for your AI agent workflows.\n\nIf Entire is not yet configured, this runs the full configuration flow.\nIf Entire is already configured but disabled, this re-enables it.\n\nIf the current directory is not a git repository, Entire can initialize one\nfor you and (optionally) create a matching GitHub repository via the gh CLI.\n\nUsage:\n  entire enable [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --absolute-git-hook-path               Embed full binary path in git hooks (for GUI git clients that don't source shell profiles)\n      --agent string                         Agent to set up hooks for (e.g., claude-code, codex, copilot-cli, cursor, factoryai-droid, gemini, opencode, pi; external agents on $PATH are also available). Enables non-interactive mode.\n      --agent-help-skill entire agent-help   Install the stable Entire agent-help skill (points agents at entire agent-help) for selected agent(s)\n      --checkpoint-backend string            Checkpoint storage backend: refs (one git ref per checkpoint; recommended) or branch (shared entire/checkpoints/v1 branch)\n      --checkpoint-remote string             Checkpoint remote in provider:owner/repo format (e.g., github:org/checkpoints-repo)\n  -f, --force                                Force reinstall hooks (removes existing Entire hooks first)\n  -h, --help                                 help for enable\n      --init-repo                            If not a git repo, initialize one non-interactively\n      --initial-commit-message string        Commit message for the initial commit when bootstrapping a new repo\n      --local                                Write settings to .entire/settings.local.json instead of .entire/settings.json\n      --no-github                            Initialize local git repo only; skip creating a GitHub remote\n      --no-init-repo                         If not a git repo, exit instead of prompting to initialize one\n      --project                              Write settings to .entire/settings.json even if it already exists\n      --push                                 When bootstrapping a new repo, push the initial commit to the created GitHub remote (implies creating the remote; without it the repo is created but not pushed)\n      --repo-name string                     GitHub repository name for the new repo (used when bootstrapping)\n      --repo-owner string                    GitHub user or organization login for the new repo\n      --repo-visibility string               GitHub repository visibility: public, private, or internal\n      --search-skill                         Install the optional Entire search skill for selected agent(s)\n      --skip-initial-commit                  Don't create the initial commit when bootstrapping a new repo\n      --skip-push-sessions                   Disable automatic pushing of session logs on git push\n      --telemetry                            Enable anonymous usage analytics (default true)\n  -y, --yes                                  Accept all defaults without prompting (in a non-repo directory: init git, create private GitHub repo, commit, and push; then enable all agents and accept telemetry)\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---2---\n/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nShow whether Entire is currently enabled or disabled\n\nUsage:\n  entire status [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --detailed   Show detailed status for each settings file\n  -h, --help       help for status\n      --json       Output as JSON\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---3---\n/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nLogged in to https://us.auth.entire.io\n  User:         @jurei733 <reichlej@gmx.de>\n  Identity:     github/67505990\n  Jurisdiction: us\n  Context:      us.auth.entire.io\n  Token:        stored in macOS Keychain\n\nActive sessions (1):\nNAME                   CREATED     LAST USED   EXPIRES\nOIDC login 2026-07-31  2026-07-31  2026-08-29  2026-09-28\n\nRun 'entire logout' to end this session, or 'entire logout --everywhere' to end all of them.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a04e66-c772-7170-b7f2-4f6daa7e2bfb","create_time":1788031331.58071}}}
