{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T19:22:21.593Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a04ef9-1419-7200-b8e0-dd3bcf84b4ac","call_id":"call_R4bJ2j1yiVpo0B8q7QNGy59H","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Internal Error ()\nciteturn31view0 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://docs.entire.io/guides/checkpoints/checkpoint-storage.md\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://docs.entire.io/guides/checkpoints/checkpoint-storage.md is not safe to open (non-retryable error)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn31view1 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/entire-files.md\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/entire-files.md is not safe to open (non-retryable error)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn31view2 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://docs.entire.io/agents/codex.md\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: Failed to fetch https://docs.entire.io/agents/codex.md: (400) Unsupported content-type: text/markdown\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn31view3 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://docs.entire.io/security.md\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: URL https://docs.entire.io/security.md is not safe to open (non-retryable error)\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a04e66-c772-7170-b7f2-4f6daa7e2bfb","create_time":1788031341.593121}}}
