{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T19:22:37.763Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_08520c685d1a1132016a93317ae92887d28949fe187a5c89c6","status":"completed","call_id":"call_iMKyBPbMX139UJn00WtDiKIV","name":"exec","input":"const rs = await Promise.all([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"brew info --cask entire\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:3000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"brew outdated --cask entire || true\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:2000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire status --detailed --json\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3000})\n]);\nrs.forEach((r,i)=>text(`---${i+1}---\\n${r.output}`));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a04e66-c772-7170-b7f2-4f6daa7e2bfb","create_time":1788031351.813865}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T19:22:51.781Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a04ef9-8a05-7732-b302-b042924aef98","call_id":"call_iMKyBPbMX139UJn00WtDiKIV","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 14.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---1---\n/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n==> entire (entire): 0.9.0\nCLI for Entire\nhttps://github.com/entireio/cli\nInstalled (on request)\n/opt/homebrew/Caskroom/entire/0.9.0 (56.4MB)\n  Installed on 2026-07-31 at 10:52:33\nFrom: https://github.com/entireio/homebrew-tap/blob/HEAD/Casks/entire.rb\n==> Artifacts\nentire (Binary)\ngit-remote-entire (Binary)\nentire (base_name: entire, shells: bash, zsh, fish) (Generated Completion)\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---2---\nWarning: truncated output (original token count: 2076)\nTotal output lines: 157\n\n/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n==> Auto-updating Homebrew...\nAdjust how often this is run with `$HOMEBREW_AUTO_UPDATE_SECS` or disable with\n`$HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1`. Hide these hints with `$HOMEBREW_NO_ENV_HINTS=1` (see `man brew`).\n==> Auto-updated Homebrew!\nUpdated 3 taps (entireio/tap, homebrew/core and homebrew/cask).\n==> New Formulae\namy: Nostr client from the Amethyst project\natomgit-cli: Command-line interface for AtomGit\nawww: Answer to your Wayland Wallpaper Woes\nb4n: Terminal user interface (TUI) for Kubernetes API written in Rust\nbashly: Bash command-line framework and CLI generator\nbetterglobekey: Reworked Globe key for faster input source switching\nbluetuith: Cross-platform TUI bluetooth manager\ncliphist: Wayland clipboard manager with support for multimedia\ncuttlefish: Build compacted de Bruijn graphs from references or reads\ndeja-vu: Local searchable memory over the session histories of coding agents\ndelly: Structural variant discovery by paired-end and split-read analysis\ndnsglobe: Global DNS propagation checker TUI\nevnx: Comprehensive CLI tool for managing .env files\nflite: Small fast and portable speech synthesis system\nfluxcd: Open and extensible continuous delivery solution for Kubernetes\nfusesoc: Package manager and build abstraction tool for HDL code\nfx-agent: Tiny, open, embeddable, native coding agent\ngffcompare: Compare, merge and annotate GFF/GTF transcript files\ngo@1.26: Open source programming language to build simple/reliable/efficient software\ngpk: TUI and CLI that unifies every package manager on the system\nhonker: SQLite message queue extension\nhttpx2: HTTP client library for Python\ninshellisense: IDE style command-line auto complete\njarl: Just another R linter\nkata: Local-first, federated issue tracker for humans and coding agents\nlazy-tmux: Save all your tmux sessions and lazy restore them\nlazyrsync: Terminal UI for rsync, written in Rust\nleaves: Text-mode disk usage visualization utility\nlfk: Terminal user interface for navigating and managing Kubernetes clusters\nlibyang: YANG data modeling language library\nlivebook-cli: Code notebooks for Elixir developers\nlld@22: LLVM Project Linker\nlldb: Next generation, high-performance debugger\nllvm@22: Next-gen compiler infrastructure\nmodal: Client library and CLI for Modal\nmysql-client@9.7: Open source relational database management system\nmysql@9.7: Open source relational database management system\nnats: Utility for NATS Server and JetStream administration\nnetwork-doctor: Network troubleshooting TUI\nnub: Fast TypeScript runtime and package manager that augments Node\nobscura: Headless browser for AI agents and web scraping\noh-my-reddit: Beautiful Reddit threads, live in your terminal\nopen-code-review: AI-powered code review tool with deterministic pipelines and an LLM agent\nopencrabs: Autonomous, self-improving AI agent in a single Rust binary\nopenkermit: Scriptable network and serial communication for UNIX and VMS\noxvg: Fastest SV