rationMs\":1768.344,\"storageKind\":\"sqlite\"}\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9501-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8962833Z node:internal/process/promises:394\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9502-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8964506Z     triggerUncaughtException(err, true /* fromPromise */);\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9503-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8967299Z     ^\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9504-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8967595Z \n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log:9505:2026-08-29T20:17:26.8968198Z page.waitForResponse: Target page, context or browser has been closed\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9506-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8969260Z     at /home/runner/work/testcenter-rewrite/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/scripts/smoke-ui.mjs:23965:57\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9507-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8969867Z \n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9508-2026-08-29T20:17:26.8970136Z Node.js v22.23.2\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9509-2026-08-29T20:17:31.9310383Z ##[error]Process completed with exit code 1.\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9510-2026-08-29T20:17:31.9421623Z Node 20 is being deprecated. This workflow is running with Node 24 by default. If you need to temporarily use Node 20, you can set the ACTIONS_ALLOW_USE_UNSECURE_NODE_VERSION=true environment variable. For more information see: https://github.blog/changelog/2025-09-19-deprecation-of-node-20-on-github-actions-runners/\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9511-2026-08-29T20:17:31.9422592Z Post job cleanup.\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9512-2026-08-29T20:17:32.0119611Z [command]/usr/bin/git version\n/tmp/testcenter-ui-full-99152988538.log-9513-2026-08-29T20:17:32.0151398Z git version 2.55.0\n--\n/tmp/testcenter-postgres-ui-99152988238.log-9698-2026-08-29T20:16:56.4340355Z ui_smoke_step=teardown-server\n/tmp/testcenter-postgres-ui-99152988238.log-9699-2026-08-29T20:16:56.4344152Z {\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-29T20:16:56.434Z\",\"level\":\"info