{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T20:45:22.835Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a04f45-1613-7620-908c-07905dfc4cea","call_id":"call_2JC4I7d5oSj2loAOBwhZlMMu","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nEntire CLI 0.10.3\nGo version: go1.26.6\nOS/Arch: darwin/arm64\n● Enabled · branch testcenter-rewrite-parity\n  Agents · Codex\n  Checkpoints sync to: origin\n\nProject · enabled\nAgents: run `entire agent-help` for machine-readable usage.\n✓ Metadata branches: OK (no remote-tracking metadata ref found)\n\n✓ Git hooks: OK\n✓ Codex hooks: INSTALLED\n  Codex-discovered hooks: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/.codex/hooks.json\n✓ Codex hook approval records: PRESENT\nNo stuck sessions found.\nImport pre-existing Codex transcripts for this repo (the past month) as\nread-only checkpoints. Imported history is searchable and explainable, but\nread-only: imported sessions cannot be resumed.\n\nImport honors checkpoint policy before scanning transcripts. If the configured\ncheckpoint_version or checkpoint_min_version is unsupported by this CLI, import\nfails even with --dry-run.\n\nUsage:\n  entire import codex [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --dry-run           Report what would be imported without writing\n  -h, --help              help for codex\n      --path string       Override the transcript directory to import from\n      --session strings   Import only these session IDs (repeatable)\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\nremote.origin.url https://github.com/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite.git\nremote.origin.fetch +refs/heads/*:refs/remotes/origin/*\n## testcenter-rewrite-parity...origin/testcenter-rewrite-parity\n M rewrite-app/apps/web/src/app/attachment-mana