{"timestamp":"2026-08-29T20:45:36.050Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a04f45-49b2-7d90-a4a4-e0ee2ecbfd6d","call_id":"call_hWER9RC8LJdXJ2oxzEqygWHF","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nNo active session found in this worktree.\n[]\nentire session attach — Attach an existing agent session\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\n\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\n\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\n\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\n\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nFlags:\n  -a, --agent string     Agent that created the session (see 'entire agent list' for registered agents, including external) (default \"claude-code\")\n  -f, --force            Skip confirmation and amend the last commit with the checkpoint trailer (best-effort; if the amend fails the checkpoint is still created and the trailer is printed for manual paste)\n      --review           Tag the attached session as an agent review\n      --skills strings   Optional: declare which review skills were run in this session. Only used with --review\n\nInherited flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\n\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\n\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\n\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\n\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nUsage:\n  entire session attach <session-id> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -a, --agent string     Agent that created the session (see 'entire agent list' for registered agents, including external) (default \"claude-code\")\n  -f, --force            Skip confirmation and amend the last commit with the checkpoint trailer (best-effort; if the amend fails the checkpoint is still created and the trailer is printed for manual paste)\n  -h, --help             help for attach\n      --review           Tag the attached session as an agent review\n      --skills strings   Optional: declare which review skills were run in this session. Only used with --review\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a04e66-c772-7170-b7f2-4f6daa7e2bfb","create_time":1788036336.050441}}}
